# ==============================================================================
# HINDI-ASIAN AUTO-STORE - ENVIRONMENT CONFIGURATION TEMPLATE
# ==============================================================================
#
# SERIAL INDEX OF VARIABLES:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 01. VIDARA_API_KEY          - Remote upload API key for Vidara.so (Primary HLS)
# 02. SAVEFILES_API_KEY       - Remote upload API key for SaveFiles.com (Fallback HLS)
# 03. PLAYMATE_API_KEY        - Remote upload API key for Playmate.to (High-Concurrency HLS)
# 04. BYSE_API_KEY            - Remote upload API key for Byse.sx (Legacy Fallback)
# 05. TURSO_DATABASE_URL      - Cloud SQLite URL from Turso (libsql://...)
# 06. TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN        - Cloud SQLite Auth Token from Turso
# 07. TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN      - Telegram Bot token from @BotFather for webhook alerts
# 08. TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID        - Telegram Chat / Channel ID for alert delivery
# 09. API_BASE_URL            - Base URL of the deployed API (Vercel or Localhost)
# 10. ALLOWED_ORIGINS         - CORS allowed origins (comma-separated or *)
# 11. DEFAULT_CONCURRENCY     - Worker thread count for batch uploads (default: 6)
# ==============================================================================
#
# DETAILED DESCRIPTIONS:
# ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# [01-04] VIDEO PROVIDER KEYS:
#   These are pre-configured with your active cloud hosting accounts.
#   Each host acts as a high-speed HLS streaming mirror for your audience.
#
# [05-06] TURSO CLOUD SQLITE:
#   Get free cloud SQLite at https://turso.tech
#   Run: turso db create hindi-asian && turso db tokens create hindi-asian
#   If left blank, the system automatically runs on local data/hindi_asian.db.
#
# [07-08] TELEGRAM BOT ALERTS:
#   Create a free private bot via Telegram @BotFather.
#   Get your Chat ID via @userinfobot.
#   Receives automated reports after every cron run and quarantine failure.
#
# [09-11] APPLICATION SETTINGS:
#   API_BASE_URL: e.g. https://your-app.vercel.app or http://127.0.0.1:8000
#   ALLOWED_ORIGINS: Comma-separated domains allowed to embed the widget (e.g. https://lytekd.com,*)
#   DEFAULT_CONCURRENCY: Default thread workers (6 is optimal for Vidara + Playmate)
# ==============================================================================

# 01. Video Storage Providers
VIDARA_API_KEY=cc6630108e04a26c58513a923b643e1d30e5c6295b9052100ab4e0578d13aa32
SAVEFILES_API_KEY=12788yw4xeco1sk20glq0
PLAYMATE_API_KEY=deaf804d60034a3e2a42ccf4a0cfd2b8f6ce1f892f00cea2cba52e57dba7d052
BYSE_API_KEY=48397uaa9vk8w0su5yrjw

# 02. Turso Cloud SQLite Database (Optional for Vercel; falls back to local SQLite)
TURSO_DATABASE_URL=
TURSO_AUTH_TOKEN=

# 03. Private Telegram Webhook Alerts
TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN=
TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID=

# 04. App Settings & CORS
API_BASE_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8000
ALLOWED_ORIGINS=*
DEFAULT_CONCURRENCY=6
